      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGFIELD AFFAIR (7) returns from a raid on the SA Cup where he placed in the heats and was fifth in the final. Won four in a row over this distance earlier in the campaign, three at this venue. Two of those were from wider draws than this so he gets his chance to return to the winners' list. HUXTON NZ (11) draws widest but is going well, placing from out deep last time and winning two of his previous three outings here. Player with even luck. This is the lowest-graded race BETTER ECLIPSE (4) has encountered for some time. Aided by a good draw so gets his chance to find winning form. HUTA NZ (5) comes back in grade on the last attempt so could be more competitive. BUZZ BOMB (10) cops a wider draw this week but has been racing consistently so is worth including.",
